    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599440/extras/20b6cf5e59ae6c737d0151937df4faab.poster.avif?t=1701350392\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599440/extras/20b6cf5e59ae6c737d0151937df4faab.apng?t=1701350392\" class=\"bb_img\" width=384 height=150 /></picture></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A Zelda-like that combines classic 2D top-down gameplay with 2D side-scroller gameplay.<br></li><li>6 Dungeons with unique theming and interesting layouts due to the combined  top-down and side-scroller gameplay.<br></li><li>Large explorable overworld with many towns, people and secrets to discover.<br></li><li>Simple yet interesting weapon crafting mechanics.<br></li><li>Fun characters and an engaging story.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join our Discord server for updates on the game, playtests and more!</h2><br><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599440/extras/4836d79994991acf304f24c5948a1281.poster.avif?t=1701350392\" width=240 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599440/extras/4836d79994991acf304f24c5948a1281.webm?t=1701350392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599440/extras/4836d79994991acf304f24c5948a1281.mp4?t=1701350392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599440/extras/20b6cf5e59ae6c737d0151937df4faab.poster.avif?t=1701350392\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599440/extras/20b6cf5e59ae6c737d0151937df4faab.apng?t=1701350392\" class=\"bb_img\" width=384 height=150 /></picture></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A Zelda-like that combines classic 2D top-down gameplay with 2D side-scroller gameplay.<br></li><li>6 Dungeons with unique theming and interesting layouts due to the combined  top-down and side-scroller gameplay.<br></li><li>Large explorable overworld with many towns, people and secrets to discover.<br></li><li>Simple yet interesting weapon crafting mechanics.<br></li><li>Fun characters and an engaging story.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join our Discord server for updates on the game, playtests and more!</h2><br><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599440/extras/4836d79994991acf304f24c5948a1281.poster.avif?t=1701350392\" width=240 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599440/extras/4836d79994991acf304f24c5948a1281.webm?t=1701350392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599440/extras/4836d79994991acf304f24c5948a1281.mp4?t=1701350392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
